# FS-CCE-390 omission PositiveDisclosureNonresponseScope
:expect-pins 1

# Missing PositiveDisclosureNonresponseScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit390PositiveDisclosureNonresponseScopeDisclosureAlternate, OblSpecialOmit390PositiveDisclosureNonresponseScopeDisclosureAlternateDuty, OblSpecialOmit390PositiveDisclosureNonresponseScopeDisclosureAlternateStandard).
# => FALSE
